{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993673008742001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cross-verve-motto","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":6},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783280642883205001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c6d686d2-90b8-4845-be2f-652e0b799629","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"a425-71e9-70df-45ac"},{"link_uuid":"8961e0ea-d9e0-485a-8ff4-d3ddf4c0978f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"3ecd-dc8c-503b-4c90"}],"description":"## Summary\nThe prompt-eval GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/eval.yml) fails on every main push: the offline 'validate every packaged eval spec' job does `from rebar.llm import eval`, but that module was moved to the evals/ subpackage (rebar.llm.evals.eval) in the 07-03 reorg (1fb66466d). Job dies at ImportError before validating any spec.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. Push to main (or run the prompt-eval workflow).\n2. Observe the offline validate job: ImportError: cannot import name 'eval' from 'rebar.llm'.\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n- Expected: the job validates all packaged eval specs and passes.\n- Actual: ImportError at eval.yml:64 (and :114) -> job fails.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] eval.yml inline scripts import rebar.llm.evals.eval (both occurrences).\n- [ ] The offline validate job validates all packaged eval specs (verified: 9 specs) and the prompt-eval workflow is green on main.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["relates_to","3ecd-dc8c-503b-4c90"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"0103cbf7-4f4d-48e1-a44e-b3eeb9ff7a7a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"62f4-0421-dd69-4380","ticket_type":"bug","title":"prompt-eval CI red on main: stale 'from rebar.llm import eval' after evals/ subpackage reorg","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["7f75884e-ff5f-46dc-b174-5f22e352a68c","c6d686d2-90b8-4845-be2f-652e0b799629","0103cbf7-4f4d-48e1-a44e-b3eeb9ff7a7a","2d3e8d40-2e05-44db-96df-697cf21f9598","b47803e8-e7da-4d7e-bdaf-d0d66aadda05","8961e0ea-d9e0-485a-8ff4-d3ddf4c0978f"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993673008742001,"uuid":"bb2076be-2338-429d-b4fa-b98c0fee25c8"}